                <l xml:id="m-97f8ad4e-772f-438a-b242-10c464afbcd4" facs="#m-bdd31300-94f1-4087-9ed9-abe7a9fba8a4" label="text-like">Sunday at Terce.</l><l xml:id="m-a37cfd53-2399-450c-970f-2132bfe07f32" facs="#m-cfec0a4d-9a49-45a6-9902-b52ab59db129" label="ambiguous">239</l><l xml:id="m-ab629285-c8fc-4b6a-8355-cae588df0128" facs="#m-3591ccdd-7673-44c8-9b24-f9c479f33c00" label="lyrics-like">a vérbo áspero. Gló-ri-a Pátri, et Fí-li-o,</l><l xml:id="m-64f941b1-35bf-4d43-9b0b-b33d2791963d" facs="#m-8c80ed49-3a71-44d6-8d61-a0986350e180" label="lyrics-like">et Spi-rí¬</l><l xml:id="m-35175d9c-038d-4d77-9509-e05690face60" facs="#m-9b759dc0-d721-4379-b6ce-a12b3eba8bd1" label="lyrics-like">tu-i Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-ca3d12e3-612f-4ac0-b35c-4e69ec831902" facs="#m-9ea33d19-265b-413c-905a-6b3de40b194c" label="lyrics-like">V. Scápulis súis obumbrábit tíbi.</l><l xml:id="m-4a36659f-c8ff-4785-8773-bec60949946e" facs="#m-4ec08fd9-8484-41ca-af38-773175e13b5e" label="lyrics-like">K. Et sub pénnis éjus sperábis.</l><l xml:id="m-e4b42bbe-b8d5-4f78-b7e1-681fc12e4669" facs="#m-78eaacfb-3099-479e-9b8c-089ed8bf4e47" label="text-like">On Passion Sunday and Palm Sunday. Antiphon and Chapter are found in</l><l xml:id="m-d423687a-5706-4d78-a014-c2d6c1f296f1" facs="#m-8a4d8c6b-06e6-454d-b921-d4a01a08b74a" label="text-like">the Proper or the Time.</l><l xml:id="m-7abe5098-66b3-485f-b8b3-70338f55f86a" facs="#m-4431d078-f320-4e97-9f80-4238330e2936" label="ambiguous">short!</l><l xml:id="m-4c59620e-dd8b-443f-8074-b4f6998c910a" facs="#m-fae0ca16-fc52-41d6-be33-8a6684ee5846" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-4b98c1f7-5cfd-40d3-92b5-2d0f4cf418db" facs="#m-2d4cc810-991c-4129-b5cb-1a4a12b8f83b" label="lyrics-like">-ru-e a frâme-a “Dé-us ánimam mé¬ am. V. Et</l><l xml:id="m-26e2dc96-f712-4e3a-8fdc-836505144dcf" facs="#m-03811a3a-5fc3-423b-aa2f-1ef327d6f8d0" label="lyrics-like">de mánu cánis únicam mé-am. “Déus. R. Erue.</l><l xml:id="m-a75be885-54a4-4efc-8e63-305ffdd616b1" facs="#m-166bd30a-7c52-4a0d-8509-fe8a2a42609c" label="lyrics-like">The V. Glória Pátri. is not said, but the R. Erue a frâmea. etc. is reveated.</l><l xml:id="m-f811198e-cbfa-4693-97c3-c469595a2212" facs="#m-8dc5c81d-2a04-4b7a-bdf0-aad4ca3e550f" label="lyrics-like">This rúle is observed for all the Short Responsories of Passiontide. in the</l><l xml:id="m-1aa0e593-8532-4b96-9945-cebf6ad3d73f" facs="#m-f5bde601-56b9-4acd-8443-979d397c3ea1" label="text-like">Omice of the Time.</l><l xml:id="m-525b0475-1ea0-495f-9053-f85b8a56e3e9" facs="#m-26cd953d-3bb8-41d9-804f-c58c64f112c9" label="lyrics-like">V. De óre leónis libera me Dómine.</l><l xml:id="m-f4313718-faf8-47a4-8f5e-a2f4106f3203" facs="#m-73e47469-2849-4917-85ae-af234dc84c39" label="lyrics-like">R. Et a córnibus unicórnium humilitátem méam.</l><l xml:id="m-f7449289-b042-4f2e-8fa2-11650358d705" facs="#m-07cff794-963c-4e15-99b1-503e745665eb" label="text-like">In Paschal Time.</l><l xml:id="m-bb7803e7-7717-4982-b323-55554d05f43c" facs="#m-13b9b4fb-67c4-42fe-b8ef-2ddadea816f3" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-3126cd33-076b-40fd-8488-670ce3c9b246" facs="#m-d3894b83-9233-4f47-b349-9d4469984437" label="lyrics-like">H Lle-lú-ia, alle-lú-ia, alle lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-623ea8a9-92dc-431c-8114-7bc476c84acf" facs="#m-b3c46213-6278-4446-ba6e-11d46bcc7752" label="text-like">The Chapter is found in the Proper of the Time.</l><l xml:id="m-d2ffdca9-52cb-404f-bdba-e5c66aa41267" facs="#m-df0f7f26-9eb8-4c46-bdf7-be2f5b5fef78" label="ambiguous">Short</l><l xml:id="m-98eaaa94-7ece-4dab-b1e4-807777fe161b" facs="#m-b1e8404e-1a84-412a-888e-1578d82c228e" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-9792b1b2-0ad7-406d-89ee-046c4a8556c7" facs="#m-51e8ed06-6d87-4d07-9ff8-0c984e575451" label="lyrics-like">Urréxit Dóminus de sepúlcro: “Alle-lú-ia, alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-2c58ca09-ac26-415e-8fce-c08957112fd2" facs="#m-630377b1-1e12-4112-b199-d7193714a317" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-16a5dcd1-e513-4df0-a5e4-6472c7ea54a3" facs="#m-8371ac09-1b47-4a05-bb9e-5f80d2ffa939" label="lyrics-like">lú-ia. V. Qui pro nóbis pepéndit in ligno. Gló-ri-a Pátri,</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>